    rdfs:subClassOf <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/EngineeredSystem> ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """system that evacuates gases and liquids from an enclosed and sealed space to a controlled negative pressure or a molecular density below the prevailing atmospheric level.""" ;
